{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"This is my entire experience since you saw me depart. — Now a request — that you hand one of the copies of my Encyclopedia to Mr. Beer in my name, which I otherwise still reserve the right to inscribe; — I had forgotten to do so before my departure. When I alighted from the express post yesterday evening, a young man was already waiting for me, in the name of his father, the Vice-Principal Matthias, the father of one of my listeners, to invite me to stay with him, which I naturally did not accept. Paper is as far as the matter is exhausted. — In the afternoon or tomorrow morning I will probably set out with a hired carriage. Greet the young ones."}}],"created":1795220937,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":146,"prompt_tokens":225,"total_tokens":371,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-R70IeZTi2lFFwmnA8YSu2sbl6CzdJPDZ","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":225,"prompt_ms":384.398,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7084355555555557,"prompt_per_second":585.330828984542,"predicted_n":146,"predicted_ms":3433.491,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.67924827586207,"predicted_per_second":42.23107035958446}}